there are 2 reasons to separate meta files from data files:

meta files are usually small files;
meta files are accessed more frequently;

For example, we may have 2 warehouses, like metahouse and datahouse, so we may use a high-performance fs for metahouse, to accelerate metadata access, then we will have a high-performance iceberg table.

